              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi zvino Jehovha anoti, \"Makore matatu asati apfuura, sokuverengwa kwaangaitwa nomuranda akazvisunga kubatira mubayiro, kukudzwa kweMoabhu navanhu vake vose vakawanda kuchazvidzwa, uye vakapunyuka vake vachava vashoma kwazvo uye vasina simba.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.16.14",
